name: ['Ageless Entity', 'Agonizing Demise', 'Ajani Vengeant', "Ajani's Mantra", "Ajani's Pridemate", 'Behemoth Sledge', 'Blazing Specter', 'Brackwater Elemental', 'Briarhorn', 'Canyon Wildcat', 'Countersquall', 'Cruel Ultimatum', 'Crumbling Necropolis', 'Deep Analysis', 'Dimir Cutpurse', 'Elder Mastery', 'Essence Warden', 'Evolving Wilds', 'Fire-Field Ogre', 'Firemane Angel', 'Fleetfoot Panther', 'Forest', 'Graypelt Refuge', 'Grazing Gladehart', 'Griffin Guide', 'Grixis Charm', 'Hellfire Mongrel', 'Icy Manipulator', 'Igneous Pouncer', 'Island', 'Jade Mage', 'Jhessian Zombies', 'Jungle Shrine', 'Kazandu Refuge', 'Kird Ape', 'Lead the Stampede', 'Lightning Helix', 'Loam Lion', 'Loxodon Hierarch', "Marisi's Twinclaws", 'Morgue Toad', 'Moroii', 'Mountain', 'Nacatl Hunt-Pride', 'Naya Charm', 'Nicol Bolas, Planeswalker', 'Nightscape Familiar', 'Obelisk of Grixis', 'Ogre Savant', 'Pain // Suffering', 'Plains', 'Pride of Lions', 'Profane Command', 'Qasali Pridemage', 'Recoil', 'Recumbent Bliss', 'Rise // Fall', 'Rupture Spire', 'Sapseep Forest', 'Searing Meditation', 'Shriekmaw', 'Slave of Bolas', 'Slavering Nulls', 'Spite // Malice', 'Spitemare', 'Steamcore Weird', 'Surveilling Sprite', 'Swamp', 'Sylvan Bounty', 'Sylvan Ranger', 'Terramorphic Expanse', 'Titanic Ultimatum', 'Undermine', 'Vapor Snag', 'Vitu-Ghazi, the City-Tree', 'Wild Nacatl', 'Woolly Thoctar']
